In recent days, the author has compiled a comprehensive summary of players' trial experience feelings and opinions, in order to better enhance the operational feel and entertaining plot of the game "Dragon Road"! Based on their opinions and suggestions, the author has made many improvements to the UI graphics, operation feel, and game experience of the game "Dragon Road". The updated content of the game "Dragon Road" is as follows:
1. Game dialog boxes, task boxes, backpack windows, various production pop ups, etc. are designed to exit by pressing the Esc key (game management settings or the Esc key have been technically intelligently judged);  
2. The game UI interface is improved according to the Steam region, with intelligent language display (supporting 11 languages), and Chinese prompts are provided for the Chinese interface in mainland China;  
3. In work mode, the system will automatically load the labor tools in the player's hand according to their job type. When carrying out production activities such as mining, lion cutting, forging, etc., as long as there are the necessary tools in the backpack, they can be intelligently triggered and directly reproduced, without the need to manually cut out and load the tools;
4. Develop a player battle shield blocking system. At present, players who are equipped with shields and other defensive weapons are supported;
5. Develop a player combat backstab sneak attack system to instantly kill enemy monsters. At present, it supports Fish Man Monster, Barracks Soldiers, Level Soldiers, Bailey Castle Male Guardians, Bailey Castle Female Guardians, etc;
6. The actions of close combat systems such as Red Fist, Short Knife, Sword, Double Sword, and Long Grass have been optimized for tactile sensation. Clicking the left button launches a regular attack, while clicking the right button launches a blocking action;
7. Develop combo attacks for close combat systems, triggering one combo with three common moves. When the weapon hits the monster, it will interrupt the combo accumulation and recalculate;
8. Shorten the distance of monster hatred. The issue of players reporting that the distance of monster hatred is too far has been resolved;
9. The eight groups of dagger movements with root displacement do not work and have been replaced with reasonable movements;
10. Add a preaching platform for Wang Yangming on Shenxian Island and a leisurely bamboo raft;
11. Add rich Chinese elements to the desks of Yangming Academy, including the Four Treasures of the Study such as brush, ink, paper, and inkstone;
12. Increase the corresponding assets of Oriental Dragon and Western Dragon in Donghai Dragon Palace;
13. Other bug fixes reported by players.

In order to better enhance the entertainment value of the game 'Dragon Road'! The author has adopted the opinions and suggestions of multiple appraisers to improve the UI operation and gaming experience of the game "Dragon Road". The updated content of the game "Dragon Road" is as follows:
1. Optimize the game UI interface and gaming experience, separate UI operations from game functions, and pause and lock the game when players operate the UI screen during gameplay;
2. Optimize the NPC dialogue system. After the transformation, the dialogue will automatically start, and players can click to leave at any time to end the dialogue. During the dialogue, pause the movement of enemies approaching the player (within 3000 units);
3. Optimize the warning system modules for key checkpoints and sunken ship guards on the Dragon Road, add vacuum collision isolation walls, and prompt players to choose "leave" or "hard break" when the warning ends. It also supports leaving and hard break at any time without listening to the warning;
4. Optimize the player's forest tree cutting system module to enhance the realistic experience of tree cutting, increase the effect of tree cutting dust, the sound of trees falling, and generate animations of logs;
5. Optimize the player's sleeping system, add the Donghai Iron Mine Coffin (used to recover energy during early sleep breaks), and develop an outdoor sleeping bag (can be placed in a backpack for rest at any time);
6. Develop a "Mala Truck" robbery system for transporting logs. After modification, kill the guards who drive the cart. Players can use attack keys to crack the cart and obtain a complete set of logs (6) and 4 wheels;
7. Develop a robbery system for the "box type carriage" of treasure chests. After modification, kill the guards who drive the carriage. Players can use attack keys to crack the carriage and obtain the entire treasure (4 boxes of medicine or jewelry) and 4 wheels;

The updated content of this game is as follows:
1. In "Dragon Road," an evil "Snake Island Bay" scene has been added to the snake head area of Snake Island in the Wu Yue Kingdom, including three snake spirit caves;
2. The novel 'Dragon Road' introduces a dangerous' thousand year old cave 'scene in the southern Tang Dynasty, including stalagmites, caves, cliffs, and a hidden stream leading directly to the Grand Canal;
3. Add barbecue seafood, barbecue animal meat, barbecue bread crab, barbecue potatoes, barbecue eggplants, barbecue corn and other barbecue foods, and develop barbecue systems;
4. Develop an object segmentation system for breaking raw wood into pieces, wood into wooden boards, wild lion meat fragments into animal meat pieces, or tiger meat fragments into animal meat pieces;
5. Develop a smelting system for iron ore, copper ore, silver ore, and gold ore to produce iron bricks, steel bricks, copper bricks, silver bricks, gold bricks, and other metals;
6. Develop iron brick and coal mine stone forging iron swords, iron pickaxes, iron axes, etc., develop iron swords and steel bricks, coal mine stone recycling to make Longquan swords, develop Longquan swords and copper bricks and coal mine stone recycling to make Xuanyuan swords and other weapon forging systems;
7. Other minor features and details optimization.

The game version of 'Dragon Road' has been upgraded from V 1.2.0 to V 1.3.0, and the upgrade content is as follows:
1. Add a wild fruit picking system for blackberries, blueberries, red berries, purple berries, yellow berries, and mushroom;
2. Add a picking system for herbs such as clover, chamomile, heather, dandelion, lemongrass, and ferns;
3. Add rock mines, coal mines, iron mines, copper mines, silver mines, gold mines, uranium mines, and mining systems;
4. New weapon forging systems such as earthen stoves, specialized steel making furnaces, and iron forging tables have been added;
5. Optimize the main screen of "Dragon Road" game, remove red and blue balls, and add hotkey prompts;
6. Integrate various index prompts on the main screen of the game "Dragon Road": health, magic, endurance, fatigue, hunger, thirst and other indices;
7. Add Shenxian Island, iron mine, and outdoor iron smelting furnace next to Donghai Dragon Palace;
8. Improve the animation of Dongfang Dragon's fire breathing attack;

[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221829265/6379779DC6D9CE975E9455C8F8D685CABCB3B1B0/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221829265/6379779DC6D9CE975E9455C8F8D685CABCB3B1B0/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]

The updated content of this game is as follows:
1. Add attack mode switch, right-click the mouse to turn on the attack, and then press the specific UI operation function key to turn off the attack;
2. Add a detailed map of the Dragon Road World, press the M key to open the map, and then press again to close the map;
3. Introducing the Eastern Dragon Clan: Little Black Dragon, Little White Dragon, Little Green Dragon, and Little Golden Dragon;
4. Add Eastern female martial arts heroes and replace the original Western female assassins. There are currently four hero models available for players to play, one Eastern male and one Western male and one Western female;
5. Add four sets of dual handed weapons and eight sets of dual handed martial arts movements;
6. Replace one set of walking and running movements for each of the four players (early players reported that the protagonist's walking and running posture was strange);
7. Add a set of UI for the main screen pathfinding system;
8. Enable direct light shadow, adjust the shadow radius from 500 to 50, and adopt a compromise solution between performance and image quality;
9. Add a set of more than 20 sword dancing and whistling sound effects;
10. Add a set of about 20 metal weapons such as knives, swords, and spears to activate the "ding ding dang dang" sound effect when hitting the opponent's monster;

[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221829265/6379779DC6D9CE975E9455C8F8D685CABCB3B1B0/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221829265/6379779DC6D9CE975E9455C8F8D685CABCB3B1B0/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]
[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221390278/3A2D2A8D4FE50D7EFF67D7479B4EDB758060518C/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31071218221390278/3A2D2A8D4FE50D7EFF67D7479B4EDB758060518C/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]

The updated content is as follows:
1. Fixed the issue of not being able to switch between spear physical attacks and hunting throws with left Shift in water!   
2. According to player feedback, the pick key has been adjusted to the F key, and the shortcut key for nourishing blood has been adjusted to the U key;
3. Improve the mechanism for ship capsizing and design transparent anti-collision walls at the port.
4. Increase the number of declining cities in the Northern Han Dynasty;
5. Modify the disembarkation mode, allowing passengers to disembark anywhere but board at a fixed dock;
6. After resurrection, the main weapons are loaded by default, namely swords and shields.
7. Deploy the knights and guards of the Northern Han Kingdom and deploy treasure chests and weapons;
8. Perform Lumen ray tracing scene performance optimization;
9. Disable movement and attack during conversation, and prohibit monster attacks. Unable to enter dialogue in combat mode;
10. When the player is in combat mode, NPCs can move but cannot speak;  
11. Free to choose the initial point or death point of the current scene for resurrection. Except for underground buildings such as the Volcano Zone City, Jinshatan Tunnel, and Dragon Temple, they are resurrected by default at the starting point of the current scene. More than 80 other scenes can choose to revive the current scene's initial point and death point;  
12. The officers and soldiers warned twice before starting the attack.  
13. Lock the operation directly during the process of playing the door opening animation. Players cannot attack or move, and enemies cannot attack either;
14. Unified interactive key, modify the unboxing key of the treasure box from O key to F key (i.e. merge picking and unboxing);
15. Prop picking and description are displayed in two separate ways. Display interactive buttons within the interactive distance;

[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31070583468635908/4DC4DD2D3652DCA84B052EDA3699A91237F71A16/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31070583468635908/4DC4DD2D3652DCA84B052EDA3699A91237F71A16/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]

The upgraded content of this game:
1. Add mount combat functions, including horses, unicorns, tyrannosaurs, pterosaurs, etc;
2. Fix game resolution adjustment causing system crash bug;
3. After accepting the task, if the task item has an address, the target orientation and distance will be displayed;
4. Add an underground palace to Volcano Island, equipped with 3 Volcano Knights and 9 Dark Warriors;
5. Add 2 overhanging cliffs in the desert and draw several sand dune corridors;
6. Fixed a bug where NPC dialogue freezes in the middle.

The updated content of this game is as follows:
1. Optimize spear aiming and attack speed, adjust spear attack aiming time from 3 seconds to 1 second, achieving fast attack or hunting;
2. Task and subtask UI prompts, adjust to automatically close after 3 seconds of opening;
3. Subtitles, sound, window mode and other configuration information can be saved for cloud storage;
4. The resurrection location has been adjusted from the initial point of the original scene to the place of death;
5. Add the function of switching between one click fast running on the left Shift and one click walking on the left Shift;
6. Add the function of right clicking on drugs such as red, blue, yellow, and purple to enter the drug shortcut bar with one click;
7. Optimize the NPC labor system on the farm, starting operation from the system and optimizing it to start operation when reaching the home scene;
8. Based on the 48 hour performance test results, the game has been significantly optimized to improve rendering and CPU performance;
9. Add sound effects for opening the doors of Donghai Longdao Grottoes and the ability to activate combat background music;
10. Optimize the free and flexible driving experience of ships;

     Due to the strong demands of the majority of players in the early stage, the developer of "Dragon Road" carefully considered and began developing this trial version of "Dragon Road". Yesterday, March 25th, the developer of the game "Dragon Road" also received the copyright certificate of the game "Dragon Road" issued by the National Copyright Protection Center of China. Therefore, the developer of 'Dragon Road' announced:
    1. Starting from the 26th, the official release price of the game "Dragon Road" has been adjusted from the original 108 yuan to a discounted price of 76 yuan (the end time of the discount is yet to be determined);
    2. The trial version of 'Dragon Road' was released one month in advance, and it can be officially downloaded and tried from today, the 26th;
    3. At the same time, the developer of the game "Dragon Road" promises that the gameplay and game content of the trial version of "Dragon Road" are no different from the official version, only limiting the opening of tasks before level 10 of the game;
    Here, 'Dragon Road' wishes everyone good health! Have fun!

