The upgraded content of this game is as follows:
1. The Black Dragon Cave has been rebuilt and designed as a panoramic cave, with a more spectacular atmosphere!
2. New optimizations have been made to the protagonist's Red Fist, Short Blade, Sabre, and Spear skills!
3. Optimize NPC loop to start dialogue and switch to non interrupted dialogue mode;
4. Optimize the dialogue content of the Land God and system task information prompts;
5. Create two engraved stone tablets for beginners, one in Simplified Chinese and the other in English;
6. Building the entrance and automatic door opening system of Donghai Longdong Grottoes;
7. Increase the magma overflow effect and magma contact death system during active volcanic eruptions;
8. Other bug fixes and performance tuning.

[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31068228490459981/DB23C9D5F73D476128510E3D08EC5A8B3813A28F/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31068228490459981/DB23C9D5F73D476128510E3D08EC5A8B3813A28F/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]

The updated content of this game is as follows:
1. Volcano Island has added a Boss - Volcano Knight, level 25;
2. Add cross aiming accuracy to hunting actions such as fishing, catching rabbits, and throwing monsters;
3. Increase the operation of picking up items on horseback, as well as hunting actions such as horseback fishing, rabbit hunting, and monster throwing, and add cross aiming accuracy;
4. Add one golden eagle mount;
5. Replace the abandoned Prince Wright model;
6. Improve the problem of floating buttocks when driving a bike, and use bone slots to fix the player on the back bone slot;
7. Modified the behavior of suicide tracking players for shallow water shoals and developed an escape program module for the shoals;
8. Optimize the volcano scene and snake island scene!
9. Snake Island adds a Snake Warrior BOSS at level 25.

[url=https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31067498213530399/CE7908E74F2115AD1B68E7123CD1FC19EA145C4D/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false][img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/31067498213530399/CE7908E74F2115AD1B68E7123CD1FC19EA145C4D/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img][/url]

The game 'Dragon Road' has undergone a major version upgrade, from the original V1.0.0.0 to V1.1.0.0, with the following updates:
1. The game has added various Steam leaderboards;
2. The game has added Steam cloud save on top of local save;
3. The game has added 34 game achievements, which can be unlocked based on task progress;
4. On the basis of supporting mouse and keyboard, the game has added perfect support for game controllers;
5. After the game mission fails, the "death exit" is improved to "resurrection restart";
6. The game has added a "game pause" function on top of the "resurrection restart" function;
7. The game adds English, French, Russian, German, Korean, Japanese, Spanish, Portuguese, and Polish on the basis of the native language;
8. Improve the combat and attack effects, increase sword jamming and damage screen shaking effects;
9. When terrestrial animals are hunted and driven into the sea, they become frightened and wait to be shot;
10. When fish and shrimp in the water are driven away from the surface, they jump and jump around wildly;
11. Improved game details such as the main character sinking and losing their life if the ship accidentally capsizes while driving;

The game update includes the following:
1. The game supports 9 commonly used international languages, including French, German, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, and Portuguese, based on the original English and Simplified Chinese;
2. Develop a "index level fog" dynamic adjustment program to adjust the corresponding index level fog module parameters according to the game scene atmosphere;
3. Develop a "post-processing" dynamic adjustment program to adjust the corresponding post-processing module parameters based on the game scene atmosphere;
4. Fixed a bug where the player protagonist inexplicably exited the game after sleeping and waking up;
5. Develop automatic vegetation generation programs for green grasslands, dry grasslands, snowy areas, flame fields, forests, deserts, beaches, and other vegetation;
6. Redesigned and deployed various scenes, repainted trees and stone assets of different sizes;
7. We have detected and optimized the data frame rate for various scenes in the game, and the game performance has been optimized to more than twice its original level;
﻿
[img]https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/31065513937914623/AF502DDBEC164956B92F195F20A9FC0B56807539/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

The game update includes the following:
1. Optimized the lighting and resolution rendering of various scenes in 'Dragon Road', maintaining a basic 4K image quality;
2. Resolve conflicts between mouse movement control in up, down, left, right directions and player attacks on enemies;
3. Add 5 achievements for martial arts identity conversion, including Little Hero, Young Hero, Great Hero, Gang Leader, Alliance Leader, and Sage;
4. Add 3 collection tasks: collect 5 types of a good horse, golden helmets and BMWs donated to the King of Dali, and the weapon of "Happy Taizu" - Panlong Staff;
5. Add various ranking lists for game players, currently launching experience ranking lists, and subsequently launching wealth ranking lists and other ranking lists according to the situation;
6. Resolve the bug of not destroying bow and arrow objects when removing them;
7. We have optimized the exponential volume clouds of various scenes in 'Dragon Road' and enabled triggers to switch between volume clouds of each scene;
8. Replace the avatar name in the game with the player's Steam username;

